7. Formal Governance Kernel

The safety envelope, calibration-trust flags, and non-inferiority margin are enforced at the type level. An actuation command cannot be constructed unless the policy supplies proof terms for all invariants. The point-valued kernel is mechanised in Lean 4 against Mathlib. The interval-robust extension is specified and partially mechanised; the remaining proof obligations are identified explicitly.

